                <pb facs="0285" n="201" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg201"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Beaupré to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                        1903</hi></date>. (Received 1.36 p.m., 23.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>September 22, 5 p.m. The proposed law concerning the canal treaty has not been
                    discussed since the first reading. No new developments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
